result twice derived because the old notation had a "t" in it.

- Kuchar, "Time and interpretations of quantum gravity" (1992); Isham, "Canonical quantum gravity and the problem
  of time" (1992). The error: the absence of time in the equations is catalogued as an obstacle to be overcome
